<title>POLAND: Kruszwica swings to loss in Q4.</title>
<headline>Kruszwica swings to loss in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kruszwica SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 1.66 vs   15.80</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			     3.61 vs    9.33 profit</p>
<p>    net loss				   0.53 vs    4.40 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Zaklady Tluszczowe Kruszwica SA</p>
<p>    net sales				123.71 vs  170.86</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 110.12 vs  138.01</p>
<p>    extraordinary		 loss     0.11 vs    0.18</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax		    refund   2.98 vs    4.90</p>
<p>    other taxes		   refund   0.09 vs    0.03</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     2.30 vs    1.55</p>
<p>    financial costs			  7.46 vs    7.83</p>
<p>    investment				16.33 vs    7.37</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit			29.12 vs   58.09</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  11.48 vs   30.32</p>
<p>    net profit				 5.68 vs   15.81</p>
<p>    net sales				475.44 vs  543.21</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 387.87 vs  440.25</p>
<p>    extraordinary		 loss     0.14 vs    0.19</p>
<p>@</p>
